{
  "_readme": "Logical name -> ordered candidate specs (first visible match wins). Prefixes: 'label:' binds to a <label> (required here — form ids are Radix-generated like ':r2e:-form-item' and change per render), 'btn:' button text, 'text:' any element text, 'dlg>' scopes to the topmost [role=dialog]. Bare strings are CSS.",
  "_status": "CALIBRATED against BNK Forge at 161.156.198.185 (self-signed), admin login, 2026-07-10.",
  "_uiNotes": [
    "Left nav 'Blueprints' -> /stacks. '/blueprints' is a 404. '/modules' redirects to /catalog.",
    "Modules tab only appears after enabling the Catalog 'Advanced' switch.",
    "Blueprint sources: Catalog>Blueprints>Sources>'Add Blueprint Source' (submit is 'Save').",
    "Module sources:    Catalog>Modules>Sources>'Add Source' (submit is 'Add Source').",
    "Credential dialog swaps fields by provider: #ibmcloud_api_key / #ibmcloud_resource_group appear only after picking 'IBM Cloud'. The region input has NO id — only placeholder 'e.g., us-south'.",
    "Project creation picks cloud provider + credential template up front (not a later 'Credentials' tab)."
  ],

